<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan 28- and 91-day t-bill yields steady.</title>
<headline>Moldovan 28- and 91-day t-bill yields steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills was unchanged at 22.54 percent on Tuesday, compared to the previous auction on October 22, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills was steady at 27.88 percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Oct 29	  Oct 22</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   3.00 million lei  6.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 5.98 million	6.87 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    3.00 million	6.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    22.54 pct     22.54 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    98.3 pct	98.3 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  98.3-98.6 pct 98.1-99.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Nov 28, 1996  Nov 21, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Oct 29	  Oct 22</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   10.00 million lei 8.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 11.58 million     16.15 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    10.00 million     8.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    27.88 pct     27.88 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    93.5 pct	93.5 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  93.5-95.0 pct 92.8-99.9 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Jan 30, 1997  Jan 23, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
